/// M07 CORE-025 "bundled HTML: 3 assert roots green".
/// Source: tests/integration/html_test.go symbol TestCurrentBundledHTML.
/// Related fixture: compiler/testdata/current/html/main.can (read at Go
/// L47, staged pristine as src/main.can at L51).
/// Disposition: RETAIN (migrate row; the old Go harness stays until the
/// integrator retires it after every linked row, variant, environment and
/// control has accepted evidence).
/// Protects (this file): canlc assert green with real-can evidence and
/// exactly 3 roots: the render invalid_tag root, the fragment invalid_head
/// root and the main hostile root (Go L68-70; fixture L10/L42/L49).
/// Live HTML semantics (hostile escape, htmx attributes/assets, safe
/// scripts, injection absence, fragment equality) live in
/// core-025-html-semantics.can; the build plus harness process shape lives
/// in core-025-run-shape.can.
/// Variants: none in this file (default only); the hostile page/fragment
/// variants (Go L126-148) belong to the html-semantics file, and the
/// optional CAN_TSC strict generated-TypeScript leg (L81-86) belongs to
/// the run-shape file.
/// Environment: CAN_BUN_ARCHIVE + macOS sandbox-exec; requires
/// can-bun-archive, macos-sandbox-exec. Logical gates SUITE/DIAG/FAULT and
/// C/R/N/S/A identities bind at P23/QHTTP; no live run now. Descriptor
/// timeout 120000ms mirrors the Go 2-minute ctx (L25).
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23/QHTTP unmet).
/// Case bundled/html-roots checks: assert-green, report-passed,
/// root-count, fixture-name, render-roots, fragment-roots, main-roots.
/// Facet map (html_test.go legs): assert-green pins the assert leg
/// (L68-70: status 0 and empty diagnostics or the test fatals "real HTML
/// assertions"); report-passed pins the real-can evidence (L68: stdout
/// contains "real-can"); root-count pins the three roots (fixture L10/L42/
/// L49: one assert root per function, 1 plus 1 plus 1); fixture-name
/// grounds the pins in the staged fixture (L47: main.can; L51:
/// src/main.can); render-roots pins render (fixture L10 invalid_tag, tag
/// "script" refused, 1 root); fragment-roots pins fragment (fixture L42
/// invalid_head, head context refused, 1 root); main-roots pins main
/// (fixture L49 hostile, script text admitted, 1 root).
/// Shared old files untouched; retirement is a later integrator decision.
